  "min_bytes_threshold": 2048,
  "question_or_target": "The corpus will grow as defects are converted into cases by B19, and every addition changes the aggregate score even when nothing about the system changed. Version the case set, report every aggregate against its case-set version, and require any cross-version comparison to be computed on the intersection with the difference reported separately. Otherwise the self-improvement loop will read corpus growth as regression and revert good work.",
